1
00:04:36,521 --> 00:04:42,521
A little bear goes a long way.

2
00:09:13,043 --> 00:09:19,043
Paddington in Peru is a family, comedy, adventure
film directed by Dougal Wilson.

3
00:13:49,565 --> 00:13:55,565
Paddington travels to Peru to visit his beloved Aunt Lucy,
who now resides at the Home for Retired Bears.

4
00:18:26,086 --> 00:18:32,086
With the Brown Family in tow, a thrilling adventure ensues when a mystery plunges them into an
unexpected journey through the Amazon rainforest and up to the mountain peaks of Peru.

5
00:23:02,608 --> 00:23:08,608
Paddington Brown (voice), played by Ben Whishaw.

6
00:27:39,130 --> 00:27:45,130
Henry Brown, played by Hugh Bonneville.

7
00:32:15,652 --> 00:32:21,652
Mary Brown, played by Emily Mortimer.

8
00:36:52,173 --> 00:36:58,173
Jonathan Brown, played by Samuel Joslin.

9
00:41:28,695 --> 00:41:34,695
Judy Brown, played by Madeleine Harris.

10
00:46:05,217 --> 00:46:11,217
Hunter Cabot, played by Antonio Banderas.

11
00:50:41,739 --> 00:50:47,739
Paddington in Peru is a 2024 American live-action animated adventure comedy film directed
by Dougal Wilson and written by Mark Burton, Jon Foster, and James Lamont.

12
00:55:18,260 --> 00:55:24,260
It is the third installment in the Paddington film series, which
are based on the Paddington stories by Michael Bond.

13
00:59:54,782 --> 01:00:00,782
The film stars Hugh Bonneville, Emily Mortimer, Julie Walters, Olivia Colman,
Antonio Banderas and Ben Whishaw as the voice of Paddington.

14
01:04:31,304 --> 01:04:37,304
The film sees the Brown family travelling through the
Peruvian jungle to find Paddington's aunt Lucy.

15
01:09:07,826 --> 01:09:13,826
The film entered development in February 2021, and the title
Paddington in Peru was announced in June 2022.

16
01:13:44,347 --> 01:13:50,347
It is the feature film debut of Wilson.

17
01:18:20,869 --> 01:18:26,869
Principal photography took place between July and October
2023, in the United Kingdom, Colombia and Peru.

18
01:22:57,391 --> 01:23:03,391
Paddington in Peru was released in cinemas in the United Kingdom by StudioCanal on 8 November
2024 and in the United States by Sony Pictures Releasing on 14 Feburary 2025.

19
01:27:33,913 --> 01:27:39,913
It grossed $192 million and received positive reviews from critics.

20
01:32:10,434 --> 01:32:16,434
A fourth film is in development.

21
01:36:46,956 --> 01:36:52,956
The film explores themes of rescue, sequel, bear, based on
children's book, aunt nephew relationship.

22
01:41:23,478 --> 01:41:29,478
The tone is lighthearted and intense.
